<title>GERMANY: Kolbenschmidt 1995/96 pre-tax profit falls.</title>
<headline>Kolbenschmidt 1995/96 pre-tax profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>NECKARSULM, Germany 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Sept 30:</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     60.7    vs 63</p>
<p>    Group earnings before tax on income  51.5    vs 53.8</p>
<p>    Group sales				  1,324   vs 1,338</p>
<p>    Parent pre-tax profit		    39.9    vs 35.4</p>
<p>    Parent earnings before tax on income 37.4    vs 33.5</p>
<p>    Parent sales				 653     vs 667</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German car components grouop is Kolbenschmidt AG. The company said it expected profits and sale to rise moderately in the business year that ends on September 30, 1997. It said it plans to resume paying a dividend for the 1996/97 business year.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
